ou win the most points, really"}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Come on, don't give up, you're the champion"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "In your mind, believe in your emotions"}, {"beat": 228, "text": "No matter if you win or lose"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "The important thing is to always keep smiling, you can be proud"}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}